==German==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|abfal}}, {{m|gmh|abefal}}, equivalent to {{pre|de|ab|Fall|t1=from|t2=fall}}. Cognate with {{cog|nds-de|Offall}}, {{cog|nl|afval}}, {{cog|en|offal}}, {{cog|sv|avfall}}.

Compare typologically {{m+|bg|отпадък}}, {{m+|cs|otpad}}, {{m+|sh|отпад}} (< {{m+|sla-pro|*otъpadъ}} < {{m|sla-pro|*otъ}} + {{m|sla-pro|*padati}}). Also compare {{m+|fr|déchet}} (several steps omitting from {{m+|la|dēcidō}} < {{m|la|dē-}} + {{m|la|cadō}}).

